# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Next.js build output
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/

# Testing
**/coverage/

# Env files — NEVER commit secrets; configure them in Vercel instead
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.local.example
**/local.env

# Vercel
**/.vercel

# TypeScript
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.pem

# Firebase / GCP service account keys (NEVER commit)
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*service-account*.json

.vscode/
.idea/
